@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title NTUST Eats — Sequence: 跨店結帳與取餐 (UC-04, UC-06, UC-08)
autonumber
actor 學生 as S
participant "PWA" as UI
participant "API Server" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "通知模組" as N
actor 店家 as V
S -> UI : 購物車（麻辣燙 + DAKA）→ 結帳
UI -> API : GET /slots?stores=mala,daka
API --> UI : 各店可選時段（未滿、≥ 現在＋備餐時間）
S -> UI : 麻辣燙 12:10、DAKA 12:10
UI -> API : POST /checkout {lines, slots}
API -> DB : 檢查停權、售完、價格身分
loop 每家店
  API -> DB : BEGIN; SELECT slot FOR UPDATE
  alt booked < capacity
    API -> DB : booked++；INSERT order (SUBMITTED)；套用加購／促銷
    API -> DB : COMMIT
  else 時段已滿
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK
    API --> UI : 409 該時段已滿，請改選
  end
end
API --> UI : 201 [訂單 A102 麻辣燙, 訂單 B215 DAKA]
API -> N : 通知店家新訂單
N -> V : 平板出現新訂單
V -> API : PATCH /orders/A102 ACCEPTED
V -> API : PATCH /orders/A102 READY
API -> N : 推播給學生
N -> S : 「A102 可取餐」(≤ 10 秒)
S -> V : 出示 QR Code / 報號碼
V -> API : POST /pickups {token}
API -> DB : status = PICKED_UP
V -> S : 交付餐點、現場收款
@enduml
